cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. To cite the research
  content of the SCC Explorer platform, follow the citation guidance
  published on the platform.
type: software
title: "SCC Explorer — applications"
abstract: >-
  Static, server-free web applications of the SCC Explorer platform on the
  history of the Congregation of the Council (Sacra Congregatio Concilii):
  a bibliographic catalogue with keyword search and charts, and a timeline
  with Julian / Gregorian dating, a papal calendar and Easter dates.
  Distributed with synthetic data.
